<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="6774675366"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:22.069"><div begin="28.665" end="41.805" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="28.665" end="31.777" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.665" end="29.905">沿途摧毁的村</span><span begin="29.905" end="30.284">落</span> <span begin="30.284" end="31.143">只剩风在</span><span begin="31.143" end="31.777">经过</span></p><p begin="31.923" end="35.076" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.923" end="33.208">真理如战衣残</span><span begin="33.208" end="33.688">破</span> <span begin="33.688" end="34.494">故乡已成</span><span begin="34.494" end="35.076">荒漠</span></p><p begin="35.208" end="38.473" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.208" end="36.608">远方恐惧被传</span><span begin="36.608" end="36.845">唱</span> <span begin="36.845" end="38.184">凶猛巨兽被释</span><span begin="38.184" end="38.473">放</span></p><p begin="38.582" end="41.805" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.582" end="41.147">宣告希望早已被刻在了石碑</span><span begin="41.147" end="41.805">之上</span></p></div><div begin="42.107" end="55.209" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="42.107" end="45.131" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.107" end="42.326">我</span><span begin="42.326" end="42.782">独</span><span begin="42.782" end="43.128">自醒</span><span begin="43.128" end="43.515">来</span> <span begin="43.515" end="43.910">悬</span><span begin="43.910" end="44.356">崖与</span><span begin="44.356" end="44.830">火</span><span begin="44.830" end="45.131">海</span></p><p begin="45.360" end="48.416" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.360" end="45.597">是</span><span begin="45.597" end="46.080">纵身</span><span begin="46.080" end="46.747">一跃</span> <span begin="46.747" end="47.248">或</span><span begin="47.248" end="47.754">就此</span><span begin="47.754" end="48.416">徘徊</span></p><p begin="48.426" end="51.658" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.426" end="49.359">勇气撕开</span><span begin="49.359" end="50.111">懦弱</span> <span begin="50.111" end="51.029">让我放手</span><span begin="51.029" end="51.658">一搏</span></p><p begin="51.778" end="55.209" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.778" end="52.237">在这</span><span begin="52.237" end="52.666">场</span><span begin="52.666" end="53.069">战役</span><span begin="53.069" end="53.511">只</span><span begin="53.511" end="53.919">为信</span><span begin="53.919" end="54.701">念而</span><span begin="54.701" end="55.209">活</span></p></div><div begin="55.219" end="1:08.445" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="55.219" end="58.544" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.219" end="55.636">魔</span><span begin="55.636" end="55.896">鬼的</span><span begin="55.896" end="56.310">预</span><span begin="56.310" end="56.891">言</span> <span begin="56.998" end="57.548">贪婪的</span><span begin="57.548" end="57.985">双</span><span begin="57.985" end="58.544">眼</span></p><p begin="58.669" end="1:01.708" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.669" end="59.229">冲破这</span><span begin="59.229" end="59.704">长</span><span begin="59.704" end="1:00.362">夜</span> <span begin="1:00.362" end="1:00.962">我不受</span><span begin="1:00.962" end="1:01.309">威</span><span begin="1:01.309" end="1:01.708">胁</span></p><p begin="1:01.965" end="1:05.052" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.965" end="1:02.589">如果说</span><span begin="1:02.589" end="1:02.984">明</span><span begin="1:02.984" end="1:03.661">天</span> <span begin="1:03.661" end="1:04.232">注定是</span><span begin="1:04.232" end="1:04.683">浩</span><span begin="1:04.683" end="1:05.052">劫</span></p><p begin="1:05.092" end="1:08.445" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.092" end="1:05.511">用我</span><span begin="1:05.511" end="1:05.924">的</span><span begin="1:05.924" end="1:06.332">热血</span><span begin="1:06.332" end="1:06.705">将</span><span begin="1:06.705" end="1:07.089">这故</span><span begin="1:07.089" end="1:07.878">事改</span><span begin="1:07.878" end="1:08.445">写</span></p></div><div begin="1:08.672" end="1:21.700" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:08.672" end="1:11.775" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.672" end="1:09.195">当</span><span begin="1:09.195" end="1:09.637">硝烟</span><span begin="1:09.637" end="1:10.400">笼罩</span><span begin="1:10.400" end="1:10.936">整片</span><span begin="1:10.936" end="1:11.307">大</span><span begin="1:11.307" end="1:11.775">地</span></p><p begin="1:12.027" end="1:15.022" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.027" end="1:12.486">我</span><span begin="1:12.486" end="1:12.870">不再</span><span begin="1:12.870" end="1:13.734">祈求</span><span begin="1:13.734" end="1:14.131">它会</span><span begin="1:14.131" end="1:14.587">散</span><span begin="1:14.587" end="1:15.022">去</span></p><p begin="1:15.381" end="1:18.264" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.381" end="1:15.816">玩</span><span begin="1:15.885" end="1:16.234">孤注</span><span begin="1:16.234" end="1:17.850">一掷的游</span><span begin="1:17.850" end="1:18.264">戏</span></p><p begin="1:18.307" end="1:21.700" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.307" end="1:18.781">哪怕</span><span begin="1:18.781" end="1:19.130">我</span><span begin="1:19.130" end="1:19.562">要与</span><span begin="1:19.562" end="1:19.978">这</span><span begin="1:19.978" end="1:20.458">个世</span><span begin="1:20.458" end="1:21.199">界为</span><span begin="1:21.199" end="1:21.700">敌</span></p></div><div begin="1:22.088" end="1:34.970" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:22.088" end="1:24.936" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:22.088" end="1:22.464">当</span><span begin="1:22.464" end="1:22.875">古老</span><span begin="1:22.875" end="1:23.643">城墙</span><span begin="1:23.643" end="1:24.064">化作</span><span begin="1:24.064" end="1:24.936">废墟</span></p><p begin="1:25.278" end="1:28.252" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.278" end="1:25.707">让</span><span begin="1:25.707" end="1:26.144">我蔑</span><span begin="1:26.144" end="1:26.998">视所</span><span begin="1:26.998" end="1:27.38